Package: MissingExposureSimulation
Title: Simulation of Causal Estimators with a Missing Binary Exposure
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Mo", "Wang", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Research code for six simulation families evaluating estimators
    of the marginal causal risk difference with a partly missing binary exposure.
    Includes simulation runners, performance summaries, figures and a report.
License: License decision pending
Imports: AIPW, SuperLearner, drcmd, mice, ranger, rootSolve, doParallel,
    foreach, dplyr, tidyr, ggplot2, knitr, rmarkdown
